        {
            "block_label": "vision_footnote",
            "block_content": "NOTE If the EVCC sends the parameters EVMaximumV2XEnergyRequest and EVMinimumV2XEnergyRequest, it is indicating a preferred operational V2X range (i.e. for bidirectional cycling) and the SECC can attempt to stay within these limits as long as possible.",
