        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2682] If the EVCC provides EVMaximumV2XEnergyRequest and EVMinimumV2XEnergyRequest, EVMinimumEnergyRequest shall be less than or equal to EVMinimumV2XEnergyRequest, which shall be less than or equal to EVMaximumV2XEnergyRequest, which shall be less than or equal to EVMaximumEnergyRequest.",
